  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened LMIS in line with international standards on labour statistics</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zimbabwe released its last Labour Force and Child Labour Survey in early 2020 covering the year 2019. ZIMSTAT requires support to integrate key indicators of the labour market information in the analysis and reporting. This includes the SDG indicators relating to full, productive and decent employment. 
The ILO will support the GoZ to:
Include in the next LFCLS, new Labour Force Framework in line with the Resolution concerning statistics of work, employment and labour underutilization of the 21st International Conference of Labour Statisticians held in 2023. 
Provide the Government of Zimbabwe with technical support towards the development of a LMIS portal.</narrative>
  </description>
